{"5056630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Ditch Effort", "steam_appid": 5056630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death upon death, humanity struggles beneath the shadow of an eternal war. Staring into the abyss of the end times. In this grimdark world, survival demands speed, skill, and the will to keep fighting for what is already lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last-Ditch Effort is a narrative-driven pixel-art character-action game featuring fast, expressive combat where you are the one in control. Take the role of Igor Emmerich and battle through dramatic encounters brought to life with handcrafted animation and told through stylized comic-book storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST-PACED STYLISH ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience responsive combat that balances high-speed action with impactful strikes. Master your arsenal, maintain control of the fight, and overcome enemies that put your timing and skill to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5056630/extras/b40041f598506bfdab3ccacfd4eada7f.poster.avif?t=1788001001\" width=1170 height=668 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5056630/extras/b40041f598506bfdab3ccacfd4eada7f.webm?t=1788001001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5056630/extras/b40041f598506bfdab3ccacfd4eada7f.mp4?t=1788001001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAND-DRAWN PIXEL ANIMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every frame, no tweening, just fast, heavy, fluid combat. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop 